[h2]Build 0.9.3[/h2]
[h3]Changed[/h3]
[list]
[*][b]Merged titles are only pushed down when they conflict.[/b] A colonist's second or third title now keeps its priorities as written unless its top priority would tie with or beat the title above it. A Doctor (priority 1) who is also a Crafter (priorities 2 and 3) now crafts at 2 and 3, not 3 and 4.
[*]The HR pages follow the colonist you have selected in the game: that colonist is highlighted and scrolled into view on the Time use and Job advisor pages, and opened in the Colonists view.
[/list]
[list]
[*]Colonists holding more than one title have their priorities re-applied under the new rule the first time you open HR after loading.
[/list]
